[276.744479292,"o","255;161;152mscript\u001b[23m\u001b[38;2;230;237;243m>\u001b[39m\r\n    \u001b[38;2;62;62;64m▎\u001b[39m\u001b[1m \u001b[22m \u001b[38;2;230;237;243m</\u001b[38;2;126;231;135mbody\u001b[38;2;230;237;243m>\u001b[39m\r\n    \u001b[38;2;62;62;64m▎\u001b[39m\u001b[1m \u001b[22m \u001b[38;2;230;237;243m</\u001b[38;2;126;231;135mhtml\u001b[38;2;230;237;243m>\u001b[39m\r\n\r\n  Added a start screen overlay on the canvas with three difficulty buttons:\r\n\r\n  \u001b[2m•\u001b[22m \u001b[1mEasy\u001b[22m — slower start (150ms), gentler speed-ups\r\n  \u001b[2m•\u001b[22m \u001b[1mNormal\u001b[22m — original pacing (120ms)\r\n  \u001b[2m•\u001b[22m \u001b[1mHard\u001b[22m — faster start (90ms), quicker ramp-up\r\n\r\n  The game waits for a difficulty choice before starting. Restart and controls stay hidden until then, and \u001b[1mRestart\u001b[22m\r\n  replays at the same difficulty you picked.\r\n\r\n \u001b[48;2;36;36;40m                                                                                                                      \u001b[49m\r\n \u001b[48;2;36;36;40m Add an optional wall-wrap mode toggled by a checkbox on the start screen.                                            \u001b[49m\r\n \u001b[48;2;3"]
